    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics has always been a challenge for me. I never had formal education, but my parents encouraged curiosity through history and art. While I appreciate patterns in nature during hikes or cooking measurements, complex equations feel overwhelming. My relationship with math is one of respect from afar—admiring its beauty without fully grasping it.",
