    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs could personalize learning by adapting explanations to individual needs, like my preference for step-by-step guidance. They should also bridge gaps for those without formal education, offering interactive examples tied to real-world applications—like cooking or birdwatching—to make abstract concepts relatable."
